<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pacific Gateway rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pacific Gateway rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist said it started coverage of Pacific Gateway Exchange Inc, an international long-distance phone carrier, with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- expects the company to earn $0.62 a share on revenue of $252.1 million in 1997, and $0.90 a share on revenue of $377 million in 1998</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1-3/8 at 29 at mid-morning.</p>
</text>
